	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 「不動の怪力」典韋アッシマーと「冷徹なる暗殺者」賈詡アシュタロンが装いを新たに再キット化！",
			"• 両武将とも、本体色は世界観にあわせてより落ち付いた色味となっているほか、賈詡アシュタロンの瞳はBB戦士フォーマットにあわせて変更されている！",
			"• 付属の「攻城兵器・部隊兵」は世界観にあわせてより落ち付いた色味となっているほか、メタリック成形の合体武装6種（甲）は「黄蓋グフ＆合体武装6種（乙）」付属の（乙）と組みあわせることで12合体巨大武装を再現可能！",
			"• パッケージイラストは新規描き起こし！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• \"Immovable superpower\" Dianwei Assimer and \"cold assassin\" Jia Xu Ashtalon are re-kitted with new outfits!",
			"• The body color of both warlords has been changed to a more subdued color to match the world view, and Jia Xu Ashtalon's eyes have been changed to match the BB Senshi format!",
			"• The included \"siege weapons/troop soldiers\" have a more subdued color tone to match the world view, and the metallic molded 6 types of combined weapons (Part 1) can be combined with the ``Kogata Gouf & 6 types of combined weapons (Part 2)'' (Part 2) to reproduce 12 combined huge weapons!",
			"• The package illustration is newly drawn!"
		]
	},
